							"top": 4040,
							"width": 288,
							"height": 312,
							"text": "DemoDataSeeder is responsible for creating initial demo data for the console demonstration. It creates sample users, courses, marks, registration requests, research papers and research projects. Main can call DemoDataSeeder at startup, and DemoDataSeeder uses UniversityFacade to create data through normal system services instead of directly modifying internal lists."
